            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-text-primary">Why We Built FundusGuard AI</h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Glaucoma is often deemed the "silent thief of sight." Over 50% of people living with glaucoma in developed
              nations—and up to 90% in emerging economies—are completely unaware they have it until irreversible visual
              field deficit occurs.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <!-- Crisis Point 1 -->
            <div
              class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3 relative overflow-hidden group hover:bg-surface-container transition-all">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-glaucoma-critical/15 text-glaucoma-critical flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">personal_injury</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-text-primary">Irreversible Retinal Ganglion Cell Loss</h3>
              <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                Unlike cataracts, once retinal nerve fiber layers (RNFL) atrophy, structural vision cannot be restored.
                High intraocular pressure compresses the optic nerve head, demanding early intervention before
                symptomatic visual field defects emerge.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-auto pt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-label-sm font-label-sm text-glaucoma-critical">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">trending_up</span>
                <span>80M+ Patients worldwide by 2040</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Crisis Point 2 -->
            <div
              class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3 relative overflow-hidden group hover:bg-surface-container transition-all">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-container/20 text-optic-disc-gold flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">medical_services</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-text-primary">The Ophthalmology Specialist Desert</h3>
              <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                In rural and developing health systems, the ratio of ophthalmologists to at-risk population drops to 1
                per 250,000 citizens. Advanced OCT machines cost upwards of $65,000, concentrating screening capacity
                strictly in elite tertiary hospitals.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-auto pt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-label-sm font-label-sm text-optic-disc-gold">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">location_off</span>
                <span>90% Undetected in rural geographies</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Solution Point 3 -->
            <div
              class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3 relative overflow-hidden group hover:bg-surface-container transition-all">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-status-healthy/15 text-status-healthy flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">electric_bolt</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-text-primary">The Zero-Friction Edge Solution</h3>
              <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                FundusGuard AI runs locally on low-cost tablets, off-the-shelf laptops, or edge microprocessors
                connected to low-cost fundus cameras. Primary health workers can conduct full diagnostic screening in
                under 1 minute without cloud reliance.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-auto pt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-label-sm font-label-sm text-status-healthy">
